  "prefLabel": "Mec 102.19 Person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 102.19 “Person” means “person” as defined in RSA 153:27, XIII, namely, “an individual, natural person.”\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15; ss by #13483, eff 1-9-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 102.14) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 100); #14408, eff 10-17-25",
